---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo worker once])

    Loader[Build evaluator loader]
    BrokerCircuit{Messaging circuit admits receive?}
    Consume{Worker message available?}
    Payload{Chunk-ready payload valid?}
    Claim{Chunk claimable?}
    Context[Load and verify pinned run context]
    Warm[Warm evaluator components]
    Cases[Read exact immutable bytes from bounded cache or storage; verify complete files and membership]
    Limits[Validate and serialize request within byte ceilings]
    Credentials{Credential absent or trusted resolution succeeds?}
    Http[Invoke bounded agent request with authorized header; bound response reads]
    Permit[Acquire Wasm evaluation permits]
    Execute[Dispatch pinned ABI adapters in sandboxed stores]
    Persist[Persist terminal transitions with bounded invocation diagnostics and retry policy]
    CheckRetry{Open retry work?}
    Delay[Release chunk and delay message until retry window]
    Complete[Commit terminal chunk and immutable receipt]
    Ack[Acknowledge message]
    Release[Release chunk lease]
    Released{Chunk released?}
    Requeue[Nack and requeue message]

    Success([Success response])

    ServiceFail([Worker error])

    Start --> Loader
    Loader --> BrokerCircuit
    BrokerCircuit -- Open --> ServiceFail
    BrokerCircuit -- Closed or probe --> Consume

    Consume -- No --> Success
    Consume -- Yes --> Payload
    Consume -. Consume fails .-> ServiceFail

    Payload -- No --> Ack
    Payload -- Yes --> Claim

    Claim -- No --> Ack
    Claim -- Yes --> Context
    Claim -. Claim fails .-> ServiceFail

    Context --> Warm
    Context -. Context load fails .-> ServiceFail

    Warm --> Cases
    Warm -. Warmup fails .-> Release

    Cases --> Limits
    Limits --> Credentials
    Limits -. Invalid request or byte limit .-> Persist
    Credentials -- Yes --> Http
    Credentials -- No --> Persist
    Http --> Permit
    Http -. Invocation or body limit error .-> Persist
    Cases -. Load fails .-> Release

    Permit --> Execute
    Permit -. Permit acquisition fails .-> Release

    Execute --> Persist
    Execute -. Processing fails .-> Release

    Persist --> CheckRetry
    Persist -. Persistence fails .-> Release

    CheckRetry -- Yes --> Delay
    CheckRetry -- No --> Complete

    Complete --> Ack
    Complete -. Completion fails .-> ServiceFail

    Ack --> Success
    Ack -. Ack fails .-> ServiceFail

    Release --> Released
    Release -. Release fails .-> ServiceFail

    Released -- Yes --> Requeue
    Released -- No --> Ack

    Requeue --> Success
    Requeue -. Requeue fails .-> ServiceFail

    Delay --> Success
    Delay -. Delay publish fails .-> ServiceFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Loader,BrokerCircuit,Consume,Payload,Claim,Context,Cases,Persist,CheckRetry,Delay,Complete,Ack,Release,Released,Requeue system
    class Warm,Permit,Execute component
    class ServiceFail error
